  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Istanbul Metropolitan Municipality Digital Twin Pilot Project, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study to pilot digital twin technology in support of the Istanbul Metropolitan Municipality. The proposed pilot would include the development of a technical plan for the introduction of a digital twin platform combining multiple digital technologies, including satellite and unmanned aerial vehicle imagery, Internet of Things, artificial intelligence, and advanced analytic tools. The objective of the pilot is to design and deploy a digital twin of Istanbul to improve disaster preparedness and accelerate digital transformation of critical infrastructure and municipal operations across the city.</narrative>
  </description>
